2000-03-04  Peter Bruin  <pjbruin@dds.nl>

	* powerpc: New directory, based on i386.
	* mach/powerpc: Likewise.
	* configure.in: Added cputype=powerpc.
	* Makefile.am: Likewise.
	* utils.c: Changes to varargs for PowerPC compatibility.

1999-04-10  Mark Kettenis  <kettenis@gnu.org>

	* global.c (SubrPrefix, RoutinePrefix): New variables.
	(more_global): Prepend RoutinePrefix to ServerDemux if it is set.
	* global.h (SubrPrefix, RoutinePrefix): Declare.
	* routine.c (rtCheckRoutine): Prefix routine names with
	RoutinePrefix.
	* server.c: Prefix function calls and global variables in the
	generated code with SubrPrefix.
	* user.c: Likewise.
	* utils.c: Likewise.
	* migcom.c (parseArgs): Parse -prefix and -subrprefix options.

	* utils.c (WriteIdentificationString): Change identification
	message.
	
	* user.c (WriteUserIndividual): Write all the import and uimport
	statements to each file.

	* migcom.c (parseArgs): Parse -prefix and -subrprefix options.
	(main): Change return type to `int'.
	* mig.in: Add support for -prefix, -subrprefix and -imacros
	options.  Rename shell variables C and M to cpp and migcom, and
	set these from variables that are substituted by configure.

	* vprint.c: New file.  Imported from FSF mig CVS archive.
	
	* configure.in: New file.  Imported from FSF mig CVS snapshot.
	* Makefile.am: New file, based on the FSF mig CVS snapshot.
	* mach/Makefile.am: New file.
	* mach/i386/Makefile.am: New file.
	* i386/Makefile.am: New file.

	* migcom.c: Renamed from mig.c.
	* mig.in: Renamed from mig.sh.
